Bundle-Name: Fennec EMF Ecore Documentation Generator API
Bundle-Description: The service contract for generating documentation and class diagrams \
 out of an Ecore model: EcoreToDocumentationService plus the code-generator interfaces and \
 the EcoreToDocumentationOptions output modes implemented by the format-specific generators.

-library: enableEMF

-testpath: \
	assertj-core;version=latest
